<section class="product-section container" id="product" aria-labelledby="product-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE LESS CLUTTER</p><h2 id="product-title">Just the cleanup your phone needs.</h2>
  <div class="product-card">
    <div class="product-intro"><img src="../assets/app-icon-20260914-eb3c9f63bc.webp" alt="Phone Cleaner icon" width="96" height="96"><h3>Phone Cleaner</h3><p>You stay in control.<br> Review, choose, then tidy up.</p><div class="release"><span>ANDROID APP</span><strong>Coming soon to Google Play</strong></div></div>
    <div class="features">
      <article><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="7" y="7" width="14" height="14" rx="3"/><path d="M17 3H6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v11M8 17l4-4 3 3 2-2 3 3"/><circle cx="16" cy="11" r="1"/></svg></span><div><h3>Similar photos, together</h3><p>Compare duplicate and similar photos.<br class="desktop-br"> Keep the ones you love.</p></div></article>
      <article><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 14v6h6M20 10V4h-6M4 20l7-7M20 4l-7 7"/></svg></span><div><h3>Smaller photos and videos</h3><p>Review settings and estimated savings.<br class="desktop-br"> Shrink only the files you choose.</p></div></article>
      <article><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="2"/></svg></span><div><h3>Know where to start</h3><p>Old screenshots, large files and unused apps.<br class="desktop-br"> Find what is worth clearing first.</p></div></article>
      <article><span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 10a9 9 0 1 1 2 8M3 4v6h6M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg></span><div><h3>Room to change your mind</h3><p>Photos stay in the bin for 30 days.<br class="desktop-br"> Restore them before that time is up.</p></div></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
