  </section>
<section class="faq-section container" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><h2 id="faq-title">Before you<br> get started.</h2></div><div class="faq-list">
  <details><summary>Are photos deleted automatically?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>No. Phone Cleaner finds items you can review, then you choose what to clear. Android asks for confirmation before moving items to the bin. The confirmation flow can differ if you have explicitly enabled quick-cleanup permission.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What happens to photo quality?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Resolution and compression depend on your chosen settings. Compare the preview with the original and review estimated savings before applying. Take time to compare photos that matter to you.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Can I restore photos from the bin?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>You can restore photos during the 30-day retention period. They cannot be restored after you empty the bin or the retention period expires.</p></details>
  <details><summary>What does archiving an unused app mean?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Archiving frees the space used by an app while keeping its data. Reinstall it later to pick up where you left off. Availability depends on your device, Android version and the app.</p></details>
  <details><summary>Which devices are supported?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Phone Cleaner supports Android 11 and later. Grant the permissions a tool needs, such as photo or video access, to use it. We are preparing for release on Google Play.</p></details>
</div></section>
<section class="closing"><div class="container"><img src="../assets/app-icon-20260914-eb3c9f63bc.webp" alt="" width="72" height="72" loading="lazy"><h2>Make a little room.<br> For your next memories.</h2><p>A little tidying for your phone. Phone Cleaner.</p><a class="button primary" href="#screens">Explore the screens again <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a><span class="closing-note">Coming soon to Google Play</span></div></section>
